{"availability":"available","full":"itsvanshgupta/ecocart","name":"ecocart","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-21T03:33:42Z","updated":"2026-10-09T11:34:15Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ecocart-pi.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://ecocart-pi.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T13:20:24.238Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T13:20:24.238Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T13:20:24.238Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T06:39:29.508Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T15:04:37.144Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T13:20:24.238Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Conscious commerce driven by explainable AI eco-grading, semantic (RAG) product swaps, and community group buying.","Demo-ready: supports a no-credential local demo mode. Configure the optional Supabase, Gemini, and AWS integrations below to enable the full hosted experience.","EcoCart helps shoppers make lower-carbon choices. Every product carries an explainable A–F eco-grade across five dimensions (materials, packaging, carbon, ethics, durability). A RAG pipeline on Supabase pgvector surfaces greener like-for-like alternatives, a personal impact dashboard turns purchases into real-world CO₂ equivalents, and group buying unlocks collective discounts with live progress."],"features":["Explainable AI eco-grading — A–F grades across materials, packaging, carbon, ethics and durability, each with a plain-language explanation. Available live at POST /api/ai/grade, with a rule-based fallback.","RAG greener swaps — semantic similarity search over pgvector embeddings, restricted to comparable products and strictly better grades.","EcoAdvisor chat — a sustainability assistant with a Gemini → Groq → rule-engine failover.","Personal impact dashboard — EcoScore, real-world CO₂ equivalents and badges computed from purchase history.","Group buying — collective discounts with live progress via Supabase Realtime."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/itsvanshgupta/ecocart/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"259efe99caf31203be38d8e775bc200504d6de69dd800bae2bfec1753f38bd0c","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T11:47:37.674Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T11:47:37.674Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Conscious commerce driven by explainable AI eco-grading, semantic (RAG) product swaps, and community group buying.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/itsvanshgupta/ecocart/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"optional","text":"A free Gemini API key is optional; without it the API uses its rule engine.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/itsvanshgupta/ecocart/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Sign in to the AWS console and select the region Asia Pacific (Mumbai) ap-south-1 (or any region, but keep it consistent).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/itsvanshgupta/ecocart/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Account plan: AWS requires a payment card at sign-up.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/itsvanshgupta/ecocart/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"259efe99caf31203be38d8e775bc200504d6de69dd800bae2bfec1753f38bd0c","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/itsvanshgupta/ecocart/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T11:47:37.675Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T11:34:15Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/itsvanshgupta/ecocart/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T11:47:37.676Z","hash":"259efe99caf31203be38d8e775bc200504d6de69dd800bae2bfec1753f38bd0c","originalBytes":14747,"storedBytes":14747,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["supabase","aws","url","frontend","lambda","api","backend","key","free","github","gemini","vercel","groq","only","group","optional","python","role","tests","build","deploy","fastapi","function","pgvector",